  "observations": {
    "songjiang-fangta-pagoda": "2017 full/base+spire views selected for material state: square nine roofs, eight upper galleries, white infill/red framing, four straight horizontal railing bars, gray weathered outer porch columns, open nine-hoop iron finial with separate central spindle and stays. 2009/2010/2013 photos corroborate form; their greenish/earlier surface colors are not merged as current2017paint.",
    "putuo-zhenru-main-hall": "2025 frontal mainhall and2013 oblique show hip-gable gray tiled roof with two main-ridge chiwen; apparent central spire belongs separate rear pagoda. Six lattice doors/two flame-shaped windows, dark wood and grayplinth. Historical rear whiteinfill/highcentralopening is evidence for older geometry only, not a certified2025rear."
